# Desktop dev config. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# GitHub OAuth App / GitHub App client id for device-flow sign-in (ADR-0007).
# Create an OAuth App at https://github.com/settings/developers with "Enable
# Device Flow" checked, then paste its Client ID below. A client id is public
# (not a secret). Loaded only in dev; the packaged app reads process.env.
FACTORY_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
